 },
 {
  "audioId": "cac7744c-c04b-4c93-89dd-91e9254a7060",
  "text": "I saw a few friends",
  "courseCode": "cym_n_for_eng",
  "role": "known",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-29T15:50:59.242958+00:00",
  "dur": 2.385011,
  "wc": 5
 },
 {
  "audioId": "6bef354b-736f-40d4-a462-f786c76c1928",
  "text": "a glass or two of water",
  "courseCode": "cym_nv2_for_eng",
  "role": "known",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-26T14:45:16.660761+00:00",
  "dur": 2.845986,
  "wc": 6
 },
 {
  "audioId": "9c21d83b-5aae-4594-97fc-0dbebbc73626",
  "text": "I didn't do much on Sunday",
  "courseCode": "cym_nv2_for_eng",
  "role": "known",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-26T14:57:01.872286+00:00",
  "dur": 3.01,
  "wc": 6
 },
 {
  "audioId": "802b0faf-2765-4e32-b50b-98203c6bb00d",
  "text": "you need to guess in Welsh",
  "courseCode": "cym_nv2_for_eng",
  "role": "known",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-27T11:19:56.407602+00:00",
  "dur": 2.862018,
  "wc": 6
 },
 {
  "audioId": "dac7191d-76a7-4a19-9f1e-e59d1d9ff5c5",
  "text": "Is that correct? Am I correct?",
  "courseCode": "cym_n_for_eng",
  "role": "known",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-29T16:06:14.354666+00:00",
  "dur": 2.630522,
  "wc": 6
 },
 {
  "audioId": "c7e196e6-13b0-4960-bf5e-dad50b440134",
  "text": "do they want to kill those ants?",
  "courseCode": "cym_nv2_for_eng",
  "role": "known",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-27T10:54:48.768486+00:00",
  "dur": 2.683016,
  "wc": 7
 },
 {
  "audioId": "48eb229e-251f-4127-8a97-1a30720148b8",
  "text": "a shop where I can buy some postcards",
  "courseCode": "cym_nv2_for_eng",
  "role": "known",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-27T10:58:17.698941+00:00",
  "dur": 3.47102,
  "wc": 8
 },
 {
  "audioId": "afbaff93-9933-4404-8c01-7a7a1cdc45b7",
  "text": "it's a long time since we saw each other",
  "courseCode": "cym_nv2_for_eng",
  "role": "known",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-27T11:02:08.24359+00:00",
  "dur": 3.487506,
  "wc": 9
 },
 {
  "audioId": "6d86e60a-6c76-4a39-b27e-201b3cfe0785",
  "text": "About how long do you think it will take?",
  "courseCode": "cym_n_for_eng",
  "role": "known",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-29T15:54:00.479971+00:00",
  "dur": 2.795986,
  "wc": 9
 },
 {
  "audioId": "6dbf6567-2de7-4bd0-8d49-f4d9fcc56532",
  "text": "I know a man who wants to help you",
  "courseCode": "cym_n_for_eng",
  "role": "known",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-29T15:50:48.866094+00:00",
  "dur": 3.09,
  "wc": 9
 },
 {
  "audioId": "d1847e6c-1a80-46f0-93fe-b6e86ae79b15",
  "text": "I\u2019m sorry, but I didn\u2019t understand what you said",
  "courseCode": "cym_nv2_for_eng",
  "role": "known",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-26T14:43:42.712645+00:00",
  "dur": 4.58102,
  "wc": 9
 },
 {
  "audioId": "e301aa9b-782c-4ca9-9748-bb49b7e72b4a",
  "text": "I don't mind waiting for a few minutes tomorrow morning",
  "courseCode": "cym_nv2_for_eng",
  "role": "known",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-26T14:52:35.303394+00:00",
  "dur": 4.755011,
  "wc": 10
 },
 {
  "audioId": "22b7bae3-1ec5-44ad-a542-7bdc84a89a99",
  "text": "we could fall if we go too close to the edge",
  "courseCode": "cym_nv2_for_eng",
  "role": "known",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-27T10:54:27.789049+00:00",
  "dur": 3.67,
  "wc": 11
 },
 {
  "audioId": "03dd6889-6e65-4a12-9ebe-dd304c786fae",
  "text": "I'm trying to find the money I left on the table",
  "courseCode": "cym_nv2_for_eng",
  "role": "known",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-26T14:55:53.72405+00:00",
  "dur": 4.922018,
  "wc": 11
 },
 {
  "audioId": "8428d2ed-8803-4f78-bb2f-a4ff08feeb29",
  "text": "why do you want to meet people who speak too much?",
  "courseCode": "cym_nv2_for_eng",
  "role": "known",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-27T11:25:46.095897+00:00",
  "dur": 4.127007,
  "wc": 11
 },
 {
  "audioId": "08a41727-e9bf-4c05-9b46-ecac12ad0d75",
  "text": "I wasn\u2019t thinking about what might have happened to the whole family",
  "courseCode": "cym_n_for_eng",
  "role": "known",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-29T15:53:35.319919+00:00",
  "dur": 4.543016,
  "wc": 12
 },
 {
  "audioId": "21374226-3e10-49a3-8e10-90d181972bd8",
  "text": "You'll see the supermarket on your left, just opposite the bus stop.",
  "courseCode": "cym_n_for_eng",
  "role": "known",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-29T15:52:47.322468+00:00",
  "dur": 4.305986,
  "wc": 12
 },
 {
  "audioId": "66110261-13d6-4c01-b253-2f6e2c0d7322",
  "text": "I think that's normal. Learning a new language is difficult. But it's so much fun when you start to have conversations, isn't it?",
  "courseCode": "cym_n_for_eng",
  "role": "known",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-29T16:18:56.065983+00:00",
